{"categories":[],"data_as_of":"2026-11-21T14:40:29Z","description":"本站近 30 天收录的 Amazon Bedrock 相关证据与变化。","evidence":[{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_77766f45c9266a4dcc8f24d34866268194cdf083dbc3d6ae1cef3ce8507925d3","internal_url":"/posts/20261119-blogs_podcasts-how-airbnb-uses-cost-per-task-to-operate-coding-ag-0-02a9f081f7/","observation_id":"obs_02a9f081f7220770d133b5928d994e7885fa25ce0b6eff6c1d405f4bdfe338d0","published_at":"2026-11-18T21:48:19Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"Airbnb 介绍了如何用真实工程任务评测编码代理模型，并通过 Amazon Bedrock 和 Amazon CloudWatch 持续监控生产表现。核心依据是每项任务成本，同时关注延迟、限流和 token 消耗。","title":"How Airbnb uses cost per task to operate coding agents on Amazon Bedrock"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_a34ab54f5ecae222e1836853e0a1863a9d9dd10307b133f33781403a03bf0ab4","internal_url":"/posts/20261118-blogs_podcasts-cut-generative-ai-costs-code-for-rules-models-for--0-ecd295cd80/","observation_id":"obs_ecd295cd80fbdb5f0bdd3a6049720c3cb955c7794916b348e1fbc196d4c17c77","published_at":"2026-11-17T21:14:55Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一篇关于降低生成式 AI 系统成本的实践文章，主张先判断每个工作流步骤是否真的需要调用模型：能用确定性规则完成的任务交给代码，只有开放、含糊或需要生成的任务才交给模型。文章还介绍了固定选项决策、结构化输出与分层升级等实现方式，并结合 Amazon Bedrock 和 AWS 工作流服务说明落地路径。","title":"Cut generative AI costs: Code for rules, models for judgment"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_98de93f0e32c6857ffd11454fbfe512bba28bc245568db1d3b67b9601ed8f6af","internal_url":"/posts/20261117-blogs_podcasts-how-moengage-built-agentic-customer-engagement-on--0-38a73038f4/","observation_id":"obs_38a73038f401258c1101cee1b87d010cae924cf6e06991abb42f655846d02772","published_at":"2026-11-16T18:16:07Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"MoEngage 介绍其如何利用 Amazon Bedrock 与 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 构建 Merlin AI，并通过 MCP 将分群、历史活动和内容库等能力开放给 Claude、ChatGPT 等兼容客户端。","title":"How MoEngage built agentic customer engagement on Amazon Be